@constitutional_shock
# scenario-ledger: SHK-24, SHK-25, SHK-27
# prose-audit: Grade A — Presidential incapacity, party-leader incapacity and political violence select live actors from stored rolls; no normalizer appoints an heir and an acting president cannot shorten the Sejm term.
title: A constitutional or political-violence shock clears its threshold
subtitle: Live offices and organisations determine the victim, acting authority and succession chain
new-page: true
tags: poland_event
priority: 58
order: 102
max-visits: 3
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and (shock_24_ready = 1 or shock_25_ready = 1 or shock_27_ready = 1) and election_2027_terminal = 0
on-arrival: {!
const order = ["27", "24", "25"];
const code = order.find(function(id) { return Number(Q["shock_" + id + "_ready"]); });
Q.shock_active_code = code || "none";
if (code) Q["shock_" + code + "_done"] = 1;
if (code == "24") {
    const permanent = Number(Q.shock_24_roll || 0) % 4 === 0;
    Q.acting_president_active = 1;
    Q.acting_president_name = Q.sejm_speaker;
    Q.acting_presidency_scope = "Countersignature and continuity only; no power to shorten the Sejm term";
    if (permanent) {
        Q.presidential_vacancy = 1;
        Q.presidential_election_due_time = Number(Q.time) + 2;
        Q.presidential_incapacity_outcome = "Permanent vacancy; constitutional presidential election scheduled";
    } else {
        Q.presidential_incapacity_outcome = "Temporary incapacity; the Marshal exercises acting authority";
    }
    Q.shock_24_outcome = Q.presidential_incapacity_outcome;
} else if (code == "25") {
    const liveRecords = Q.rival_group_records || [];
    const brokerIds = ["pis_party", "ko_party", "p2050_party", "psl_party"];
    const candidates = [Q.leader].concat(brokerIds.map(function(id) {
        const record = liveRecords.find(function(entry) {
            return entry && entry.id == id && entry.active;
        });
        return record ? record.leader : "";
    })).filter(function(name, index, all) {
        return name && name != Q.president_name && name != Q.prime_minister &&
            name != "None" && all.indexOf(name) == index;
    });
    Q.shock_party_leader = candidates.length
        ? candidates[Number(Q.shock_25_roll || 0) % candidates.length]
        : Q.leader;
    Q.shock_25_outcome = Q.shock_party_leader + " becomes incapacitated; the relevant authored succession opens";
    if (Q.shock_party_leader == Q.pis_leader) Q.pis_collapse_pressure = Math.max(68, Number(Q.pis_collapse_pressure || 0));
    if (Q.shock_party_leader == Q.ko_leader) Q.ko_collapse_pressure = Math.max(68, Number(Q.ko_collapse_pressure || 0));
    if (Q.shock_party_leader == Q.leader) Q.pres_feedback_leadership_challenge = 1;
    if (Q.shock_party_leader == Q.p2050_leader) Q.p2050_coalition_dissent = Math.max(65, Number(Q.p2050_coalition_dissent || 0));
    if (Q.shock_party_leader == Q.psl_leader) {
        Q.psl_stage = Math.max(2, Number(Q.psl_stage || 0));
        Q.psl_done = 0;
    }
} else if (code == "27") {
    const victims = [Q.trans_candidate_done ? Q.trans_candidate_name : "", Q.media_harassment_target, Q.leader].filter(Boolean);
    const sites = ["a campaign office", "a protest assembly", "a constituency meeting"];
    Q.shock_violence_victim = victims[Number(Q.shock_27_roll || 0) % victims.length];
    Q.shock_violence_site = sites[Math.floor(Number(Q.shock_27_roll || 0) / 7) % sites.length];
    Q.shock_27_outcome = "Political violence targets " + Q.shock_violence_victim + " at " + Q.shock_violence_site;
    Q.minority_safety -= 9;
    Q.public_trust -= 5;
    Q.far_right_agenda += 5;
}
Q.news_headline = code ? Q["shock_" + code + "_outcome"] : "No constitutional shock";
!}

= [+ date_label +] — Office, person and institution

[? if shock_active_code = "24": **[+ presidential_incapacity_outcome +].**
Acting President **[+ acting_president_name +]** receives **[+
acting_presidency_scope +]**. Temporary incapacity does not schedule an
election; permanent vacancy does.?]
[? if shock_active_code = "25": **[+ shock_party_leader +]** cannot continue.
No heir is assigned here. The relevant live party's authored succession chain
receives the pressure and chooses among eligible organisers.?]
[? if shock_active_code = "27": **[+ shock_violence_victim +]** is attacked at
**[+ shock_violence_site +]**. Investigation, joint condemnation, protection
and opportunistic blame have different escalation effects.?]

- @constitutional_shock_joint
- @constitutional_shock_exploit

@constitutional_shock_joint
title: Preserve continuity, investigate and organise joint condemnation
subtitle: Protect the person and institution without changing the election or selecting an heir.
on-arrival: {!
